    "api_info" : {
      "title" : "MCP Tools",
      "description" : "Creates or registers an MCP in the system and retrieves the list of tools associated with it. This operation allows configuring MCP details such as name, endpoint, and authentication, and returns the tools available under the configured MCP.\n\nInput Parameters:\nauthInfo (object/string): Authentication details required to access the MCP.\nauthType (string): Type of authentication used (e.g., API key, OAuth).\nmcpName (string): Name of the MCP.\nmcpEndpoint (string): Endpoint URL of the MCP.\nOutput Parameters:\nmcpId (string): Unique identifier of the created MCP.\ntools (array): List of tools available from the MCP.\nstatus (string): Status of the operation (e.g., success or failure).\nerror (string): Error message in case the operation fails."
    },
